Subject: [PATCH] VBA: Word tables, notes, hyperlinks and Document members macros commonly use

Rows and Columns Add, Delete, First, Last and Cells; Table.Range across cells;
Style, Borders.Enable, widths; Cell Merge, Shading, VerticalAlignment; Footnotes,
Endnotes, Hyperlinks; ExportAsFixedFormat, statistics, Undo, TrackRevisions;
Paragraph Next and Previous; PageSetup paper; Variables create on write.
